            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><br><strong>THE STORY:</strong><br><br>Bob and his best friend, Buddy, have travelled the biomes of Highworld using the mighty Realmgates. But when a huge explosion throws Highworld into chaos and separates Bob from his one true love, Starbrite, the blue little Orbite is given incredible power from above and sets out on a quest to bring justice to the evil demons plaguing his world.<br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong><br><br>Super Mega Bob is a 2D SHMUP (shoot-em-up) filled with super intense bullet-dodging, awesome pixel art, insane level design, and epic boss battles. If you're looking for something that will challenge your retro gaming reflexes while providing you with a beautifully nostalgic gaming environment, Super Mega Bob is your kind of game.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    160 levels<br></li><li>    10 bosses<br></li><li>    200+ upgrades<br></li><li>    5 biomes<br></li><li>    Original 8-bit soundtrack<br></li><li>    Beautiful pixel art<br></li><li>    Real-time lighting<br></li><li>    400 different hat and costume combinations</li></ul><br><strong>SUPPORTED RESOLUTIONS:</strong> 1024x768, 800x600<br><br><strong>TRY THE DEMO!</strong><br><br>Please don't buy a game you're not certain you like - try the demo! The full game adds many more features, but the demo will give you a good idea of whether or not Super Mega Bob is something you'll enjoy.<br><br>DOWNLOAD DEMO: ",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><br><strong>THE STORY:</strong><br><br>Bob and his best friend, Buddy, have travelled the biomes of Highworld using the mighty Realmgates. But when a huge explosion throws Highworld into chaos and separates Bob from his one true love, Starbrite, the blue little Orbite is given incredible power from above and sets out on a quest to bring justice to the evil demons plaguing his world.<br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong><br><br>Super Mega Bob is a 2D SHMUP (shoot-em-up) filled with super intense bullet-dodging, awesome pixel art, insane level design, and epic boss battles. If you're looking for something that will challenge your retro gaming reflexes while providing you with a beautifully nostalgic gaming environment, Super Mega Bob is your kind of game.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    160 levels<br></li><li>    10 bosses<br></li><li>    200+ upgrades<br></li><li>    5 biomes<br></li><li>    Original 8-bit soundtrack<br></li><li>    Beautiful pixel art<br></li><li>    Real-time lighting<br></li><li>    400 different hat and costume combinations</li></ul><br><strong>SUPPORTED RESOLUTIONS:</strong> 1024x768, 800x600<br><br><strong>TRY THE DEMO!</strong><br><br>Please don't buy a game you're not certain you like - try the demo! The full game adds many more features, but the demo will give you a good idea of whether or not Super Mega Bob is something you'll enjoy.<br><br>DOWNLOAD DEMO: ",
